<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>When it comes to cloaks in Phase 3, there are a handful of incredibly powerful drops that can only be acquired by completing a <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> raid on heroic difficulty without ever wiping, making them both remarkably rare and something many specs basically will not replace for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>Considering that, they will be out of reach for most players, which is why sticking to the previous Phase BiS or picking up the <span class="q4">Maiden</span> cloak is likely the way to go. All in all, the stat gain from any of these is not a big gamechanger for Discipline, so ultimately there's no need to overly concern yourself with them.<br/>
