<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>This slot technically has the best offpiece item in the ilvl 258 <span class="q4">Robe of Triumph</span> by a very small margin, but there is quite a significant amount of competition for the required Regalias with them being able to be turned into any of the five tier set pieces, so opting for the offpiece legs is a much more reasonable choice for any Discipline Priest.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, the <span class="q4">Ascent Robes</span> are also a possible choice to use alongside your T8 4p and roughly on par with the legs and gloves options. However, it also has the issue of only providing you with less desirable haste as a secondary stat, so in exchange for getting slightly higher spellpower than when opting for the <span class="q4">Deeping Void</span> legs, you miss out on a massive 3% crit from these two slots alone.<br/>
