<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>The top choice for this slot are the rare item level 258 hardmode boots, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46050/starlight-treads">
