<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>The T9 neck option is perfectly itemized for casters, making it unlikely you will be able to take it. However, both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45443/charm-of-meticulous-timing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charm of Meticulous Timing</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> aren't considerably worse so there's no harm in sticking to them in Phase 3, though you might want to upgrade to the <span class="q4">Binding Elements</span> neck for a better combination of secondary stats eventually.<br/>
<br/>While the personal stat gain from <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=24116/eye-of-the-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of the Night</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=24121/chain-of-the-twilight-owl">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chain of the Twilight Owl</span></a> is low, they provide spell power or crit rating to your party, technically making them the best for overall raid benefit.<div class="pad"></div>
