<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>When it comes to rings there are two new options worth considering, but realistically we will be holding onto previous Phase BiS for a long time. <br/>
<br/>The first of them is a direct upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46096/signet-of-soft-lament">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Soft Lament</span></a> in every way, which means that it's contested by all of your caster dps who also benefit more from the slight stat boost. <br/>
<br/>On the other hand, the <span class="q4">Darkmender</span> ring has the typical healer gear stat distribution so only a few people in your raid will be after it, though it only offers a moderate amount of spellpower and intellect while also trading crit for mp5, making it best to pass it to your other healers first.<div class="pad"></div>
