<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Discipline Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> is still your top trinket choice and will most likely last you all the way until Heroic ICC, or even further, but can also be obtained from the ten-man version of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4493/the-obsidian-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Obsidian Sanctum</span></a>. That means you should try to run it every single reset until you get it, simply bring along some guildmates after your main raid to clear it within a couple minutes.<br/>
<br/>Luckily, Phase 3 has yet another great spell power trinket to run alongside your Illustration. <span class="q4">Solace</span> not only has an additional ten spellpower compared to Show of Faith but also grants over double the Mp5 of it, so it's an easy pick for your second trinket slot. Just keep in mind that the heroic and normal version of it cannot be used together in WotLK Classic. <br/>
<br/>Finally, there are still three decent regeneration trinkets from the last phase but with proper <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47537/rapture">
